cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ForShor in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ForShor: Formal Verification of Shor's Algorithm in Lean 4 with Verified Resource Estimation"
abstract: >-
  A formal verification of Shor's algorithm in Lean 4, including verified
  resource estimation: an implementation of order finding built on fast
  (Toom-Cook) multiplication is verified from a high-level gate language down to
  a low-level abstract machine, with a machine-checked O(n^(2+epsilon)) gate-count
  bound for the compiled circuit.
type: software
